* ''A browser leaf floors the secrets plane by established absence'' (seat, talked out, 2026-11-07; overrulable). The secrets plane stands node-only (the vault rests on the node, never on a surface: the stories' lean 5 above); a browser leaf floors it by established absence (`NO_CONTRACT_SECRETS_PLANE`), and the node's face-catalog arc stays off the browser. A CAS read's audience reads off the asking island's relation: the daemon island in process, a pool wiki its plane, the herm and the HTTP `/cas` face the world; the genesis inventory declares its public bytes. Both ride `P27`'s lane, parked (#/the-order, rank 32).

